UPDATE companies SET description='Qorvo Inc. is a wireless semiconductor company headquartered in Greensboro, North Carolina, founded in 2015.

Qorvo designs and manufactures radio frequency (RF) solutions, wireless chipsets, and switches. It operates GaN and GaAs foundry services, advanced packaging, die preparation, and space screening through its U.S. manufacturing facilities.

The company serves automotive, consumer, defense and aerospace, industrial and enterprise, infrastructure, and mobile markets. Its customer base includes Lockheed Martin for defense applications, Pozyx for dairy farm productivity tracking, and Budweiser Budvar for logistics solutions, according to published success stories.

Qorvo emphasizes an integrated flow from RF design to qualified hardware, combining process, packaging, and test to reduce iteration cycles. The company states it prioritizes employee well‑being, environmental sustainability, and supply chain excellence as part of its mission to connect, protect, and power the planet.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["GaN foundry services", "GaAs foundry services", "Advanced packaging", "Die preparation", "Space screening", "RF design services", "Evaluation board development", "Simulation tools (QSPICE)", "Technical documentation and design resources", "Silicon die prep", "Foundry services", "RF solutions manufacturing", "Wireless chipset manufacturing", "Switch manufacturing"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Consumer", "Defense & Aerospace", "Industrial & Enterprise", "Infrastructure", "Mobile", "RF Communications", "Aerospace"], "materials": ["Gallium Nitride (GaN)", "Gallium Arsenide (GaAs)", "Silicon"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Integrated GaN/GaAs foundry, packaging, and test services in U.S. facilities", "End-to-end path from RF design to qualified hardware", "Combined process, packaging, and test to reduce iteration cycles", "Space screening and die preparation capabilities", "Trusted U.S. manufacturing for defense and aerospace applications"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2015 -> db", "Headquarters in Greensboro, North Carolina -> db", "Employee count 5000-9999 -> db", "Products: RF Solutions, Wireless Chipsets, Switches -> db", "Industries served: Mobile, RF Communications, Aerospace -> db", "Combination with Skyworks announced on homepage -> /", "GaN and GaAs foundry services, advanced packaging, die prep, space screening -> /", "U.S. manufacturing for trusted production -> /", "End-to-end path from RF design to qualified hardware -> /", "Reduced iteration cycles through combined process, packaging, and test -> /", "Industries: automotive, consu