ness practices -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Quad 4 Plastics provides precision injection molding and plastic thermoforming services for companies nationwide", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='quad-4-plastics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Cable Contractors, Inc. (QCCI) is an Orlando, Florida-based low-voltage systems contractor licensed and insured in the state. The company serves Central Florida with design, installation, testing, and support for structured cabling, fiber optics, wireless access, security, surveillance, CATV, CCTV, and business communication systems.

QCCI delivers end-to-end low-voltage infrastructure services including structured cabling, fiber optic backbone and distribution, security and surveillance systems, business phone systems, intercom systems, and network infrastructure. The firm follows a four-step process—assess, design, install, and support—to engineer solutions for reliability, performance, and future growth. No facility size or headcount figures are disclosed.

The contractor works across commercial offices, education, aviation, hospitality, multifamily, and municipal/public facilities. Named clients include the Greater Orlando Aviation Authority (voice/data/CATV, wireless access points, IP cameras, fiber installation and OTDR testing) and Orange County Public Schools (voice/data/CATV, paging, fiber terminations). Rosen Hotels & Resorts is also listed as a organization.

QCCI emphasizes being "Built on Experience. Driven by Innovation." and cites licensed and insured status, industry-certified technicians, on-time/on-budget delivery, cutting-edge technology, safety and code compliance, and proven field experience as differentiators. The company states a customer-first focus with a commitment to 100% customer satisfaction.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structured cabling design and installation", "Fiber optic installation, termination, splicing, and OTDR testing", "Security systems (access control, intrusion prevention)", "Surveillance systems (IP cameras, remote monitoring, smart analytics)", "CATV and CCTV systems", "Business phone systems", "Intercom systems (audio/video for schools/institutions)", "Wireless access point deployment", "Network infrastructure", "Systems integration and support", "Project assessment and design", "Ongoing maintenance and support"], "industries": ["Commercial offices", "Education", "Aviation", "Hospitality", "Multifamily residential", "Municipal/public facilities"], "materials": ["Fiber optic cable", "Structured cabling (copper)", "Coaxial cable"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed & insured in Florida", "Industry-certified technicians", "On-time, on-budget delivery", "Cutting-edge technology", "Safety & code compliance", "Proven field experience"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Orlando, Florida -> db", "Licensed & insured in Florida -> /", "Certified Florida Contractor -> /", "Services: structured cabling, fiber optics, wireless, security, surveillance, CATV, CCTV, business communication systems -> /", "Process: Assess, Design, Install, Support -> /services", "Industries served: Commercial Offices, Education, Aviation, Hospitality, Multifamily, Municipal/Public Facilities -> /services", "Clients: Greater Orlando Aviation Authority, Orange County Public Schools, Rosen Hotels & Resorts -> /", "Project details for GOAA