UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Manufacturing Services Inc. (QMS) operates from a 52,000-square-foot facility in Lake Mary, Florida, within Central Florida''s technology corridor. The company was founded in 1995 and transitioned to an employee-owned ESOP structure, aligning every worker''s stake with the business''s long-term performance.

QMS delivers full-service electronics manufacturing, spanning PCB assembly, rapid prototyping, engineering support (DFM, DFQ, DFT), program management, testing (including flying-probe and X-ray), conformal coating, and repair depot services. The shop runs automated SMT lines capable of 01005 placement, nitrogen-purge reflow, and a PVA conformal coating system, supported by statistical process control across ten data collection centers.

The customer base spans industrial, military, medical, networking, entertainment, transportation, unmanned aerial systems, traffic management, and life-safety sectors. References include defense contractors, building security system manufacturers, and electrical test equipment makers who rely on QMS for both through-hole and surface-mount assemblies built to J-STD-001 and inspected to IPC-A-610.

Leadership emphasizes that the ESOP culture drives continuous improvement and personal accountability, while the AS9100-certified quality system and a dedicated Fast Track program compress lead times without sacrificing compliance. The company states its founding principle was to exceed customer expectations through technical excellence, superior service, and unrelenting tenacity.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','J-STD-001','IPC-A-610']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Assembly", "PCB Prototyping", "Engineering Services", "Design for Manufacturability (DFM)", "Design for Quality (DFQ)", "Design for Testing (DFT)", "Program Management", "Testing (Flying Probe, X-Ray)", "Conformal Coating", "Repair Depot Services", "New Product Introduction (NPI)", "Process Development", "Supply Chain Coordination", "Rapid Manufacturing", "Fast Track Program", "Automated SMT Placement (01005)", "Nitrogen Purge Reflow", "Statistical Process Control", "J-STD-001/IPC-A-610 Compliance", "ESD Control (ANSI/ESD S20.20)"], "industries": ["Industrial", "Military", "Medical", "Networking", "Entertainment", "Transportation", "Unmanned/UAV", "Traffic Management", "Life Safety"], "materials": ["Solder alloys (J-STD-006)", "Solder pastes (J-STD-005)", "Fluxes (J-STD-004)", "Moisture-sensitive components (J-STD-033)", "Electronic components", "Printed circuit boards"], "equipment": ["PVA Conformal Coating Line", "Takaya APT-1600 Flying Probe Tester", "AI Capable High-Speed Panasonic SMT Line", "X-Ray Analysis System", "Automated SMT Placement Machines (01005 capable)", "Nitrogen Purge Reflow Oven"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Employee-owned ESOP structure aligning staff incentives with customer outcomes", "Fast Track program for accelerated manufacturing cycles", "In-house conformal coating via PVA automated line", "Automated SMT placement down to 01005 package size"], "facts_used": ["Company name, location, founding year, ownership type -> /about", "Headquarters city/state -> db", "Facility size 52,000 sq ft -> /", "Certifications ISO9001, AS9100 -> db", "Certifications detail ISO 9001:2015, AS9100:2016 -> /quality", "Capabilities list -> /services, /", "Industries served -> /", "Equipment: PVA line, Takaya APT-1600, Panasonic SMT line -> /, /services", "Materials standards J-STD-004,005,006,033 -> /quality", "Employee-owned ESOP -> /about, /", "Fast Track program -> /services", "Quality standards J-STD-001, IPC-A-610, ANSI/ESD S20.20 -> /quality", "Testimonials from defense contractor, security systems, test equipment -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "QMS is a full-service Electronics Manufacturing Services provider, located in Central Florida''s technology hub. Founded in 1995 and emerging as the region''s premier Electronics Contract Manufacturer", "founded_year": "1995", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Employee-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='quality-manufacturing-services-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Quality Quick Print, known as QQP, operates from Aberdeen, South Dakota, with additional locations in Pierre, Rapid City, and Belle Fourche.

QQP provides a broad range of print and branding services, including commercial printing, signs and banners, custom apparel decorated via embroidery and screen printing, laser engraving, graphic design, mailing and direct-mail fulfillment, promotional products, and copy-center work. The company also operates MIM (Marketing Inventory Management) storefronts, an online platform that streamlines ordering for branded merchandise and employee apparel. Production is handled across its four South Dakota facilities, supported by a management team that includes directors of sales, technology, operations, and MIM solutions.

The company serves businesses, organizations, and events throughout the region that need branded materials, trade-show displays, vehicle graphics, awards, drinkware, and custom clothing.

