UPDATE companies SET description='Qualus was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Brooklyn Park, Minnesota. The company operates as a pure-play power infrastructure services firm with additional offices across the United States and Canada, including a headquarters and relay training lab in Lake Mary, Florida.

The firm delivers end-to-end power infrastructure solutions spanning advisory and planning, engineering, program management, energy efficiency, applied solutions, and specialized field services. Its digital capabilities include complex grid advisory, SCADA, systems integration, and implementation services. Qualus supports transmission line and substation design, distribution network resilience, underground distribution, DER/renewables/microgrid integration, mission-critical power, and power generation lifecycle support. The company maintains a multi-state footprint with offices and shops in over 20 locations, plus operations in British Columbia and Ontario.

Qualus serves utilities, generation and energy storage operators, commercial and industrial facilities, data centers, and government agencies. Named clients include the U.S. Department of Energy and Natural Resources Canada. The company also runs QualU, a training program for power industry professionals, and operates a relay training lab and apparatus training center.

Qualus emphasizes a safety-first culture in which every employee holds stop-work authority, underpinned by human performance principles. Quality assurance and control are executed through independent design reviews, equipment inspections, audits, and a repository of standardized procedures. The firm publishes a sustainability report and positions its purpose-driven capabilities around the energy transition and grid resilience.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Complex Grid Advisory", "SCADA", "Systems Integration", "Implementation Services", "Advisory and Planning", "Engineering", "Program Management", "Energy Efficiency", "Applied Solutions", "Specialized Field Services", "Transmission Line Design", "Substation Design and Modernization", "Distribution Network Design", "Underground Distribution", "DER/Renewables/Microgrid Integration", "Mission-Critical Power Solutions", "Power Generation Lifecycle Support", "Digital Transformation", "Grid Modernization", "Resiliency Solutions", "Operational Excellence", "Quality Assurance/Quality Control", "Independent Design Reviews", "Equipment Inspections and Audits", "Standardized Procedures and Work Instructions", "Power Industry Training (QualU)", "Relay Training", "Apparatus Training"], "industries": ["Utilities", "Generation & Energy Storage", "Commercial & Industrial", "Data Centers", "Government"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Employee stop-work authority for safety hazards", "Independent design reviews and equipment inspections", "QualU training program with relay and apparatus training centers", "24/7 emergency hotline for mission-critical support", "Multi-location presence across the U.S. and Canada"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1984 -> db, /, /about-us, /services, /quality", "Headquarters Brooklyn Park, MN -> db, /about-us", "Lake Mary, FL headquarters & relay training lab -> /about-us", "20+ U.S. offices and Canadian location