UPDATE companies SET description='RBW, legally RBW Studio LLC, was founded in 2007 and is headquartered in Kingston, New York. The independent, B Corporation–certified company operates a 100,000‑square‑foot manufacturing and innovation facility that opened in 2022, consolidating design, engineering, and production under one roof.

RBW also serves as the exclusive U.S. supplier for the Spanish brand Arkoslight, expanding its catalog with award‑winning European designs.

RBW’s primary customers are architects, lighting designers, and specifiers working on commercial office, hospitality, restaurant, and residential projects. Installations include the Noma restaurant in Copenhagen and Fortune 500 corporate offices across the United States. A national‑accounts program supports multi‑location rollouts for design firms and end users.

